tSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"starts","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"PossiblePrefix","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"possiblePrefix","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PossiblePrefix","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"areEquivalent","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PossiblePrefix","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PossiblePrefix","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"title":"Cliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"title":"MaximalCliques","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/starts(with:by:)":{"title":"starts(with:by:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/starts(with:by:)","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/starts(with:by:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"starts","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"PossiblePrefix","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PossiblePrefix","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":